      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أمّد</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْمِيدٌ</span>, <i>He declared the time,
considered with regard to its end;</i> or <i>the utmost,</i>
or <i>extreme, extent, term, limit, point,</i> or <i>reach;</i>
expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيَّنَ الأَمَدَ</span>. (K.)

